message: "If you use or adapt this skill, please cite it as below. It was created by NMG under the mentorship of EO as part of the OE4BW 2026 programme."
type: software
title: "STEAM-SEL Lesson Designer: an AI skill for arts-integrated Social-Emotional Learning"
version: "1.8"
date-released: "2026-11-18"
authors:
  - name: "NMG"
license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/nmg-002/steam-sel-lesson-designer"
url: "https://github.com/nmg-002/steam-sel-lesson-designer"
abstract: >-
  An open AI skill that helps educators weave doodling, music and drama into
  any subject so that learners build Empathy, Mindfulness, Critical Inquiry
  and Compassion (EMC²), with optional links to real-world issues and the
  Sustainable Development Goals. It interviews the educator one
  multiple-choice question at a time, then writes lesson plans and classroom
  resources. Created by NMG under the mentorship of EO as part of the OE4BW 2026
  programme, based on Keep Calm
  and STEAM Ahead! Handbook for Educators, Edition 2 (2026). Drafted with the help of AI
  (Claude, by Anthropic) and reviewed by the creator.
keywords:
